{"id":"ehto","lemma":"это","pos":"pron","rank":7,"glosses":["this, that, it"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/54/Ru-%D1%8D%D1%82%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%8D%D1%82%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это для меня?","en":"Is this for me?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1267793","words":[null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Где я могу найти это?","en":"Where can I find it?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/656030","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to find"},null]},{"text":"Простите, это ваше?","en":"Excuse me, is this yours?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283491","words":[{"g":"to excuse","l":"простить"},null,{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"}]},{"text":"Пожалуйста, прекрати это.","en":"Please stop it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283280","words":[{"g":"please"},{"g":"to stop","l":"прекратить"},null]},{"text":"Давай сделаем это сейчас.","en":"Let's do it now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283327","words":[{"g":"let's"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},null,{"g":"now"}]}]}